          Explanation line is suppressed for ED fields with a known
          source: the XML tag button above already says where the
          value came from, and the generic "no rule recorded" copy
          was misleading next to a chip that DOES point at a recorded
          XPath. Non-ED fields without a rule still see this copy.
        -->
        <p
          v-if="!hasXmlSources"
          class="extraction-field-card__explanation"
        >
          {{ $t(field.explanation_key || 'extraction_insights.no_rule') }}
        </p>
      </div>
